---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description="How Evo Dental collects, uses and protects your personal information." updated="October 2026">
  <p>
    This is template wording and should be reviewed by a qualified adviser before the website goes live. It explains,
    in plain language, how {site.name} handles the information you share with us.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact details you provide when requesting an appointment, such as your name, phone number and email address.</li>
    <li>Details about the treatment you are interested in and any notes you choose to add.</li>
    <li>Basic, anonymous usage information that helps us keep the website working well.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    We use your details only to arrange and manage your appointments, respond to your questions and provide dental
    care. We do not sell your information or share it for marketing by others.
  </p>

  <h2>The website assistant</h2>
  <p>
    The chat assistant on this site runs entirely in your browser. Your conversation is kept only in temporary browser
    storage for the current visit and is not sent to us or to any third party.
  </p>

  <h2>Keeping your information safe</h2>
  <p>
    Patient records are stored securely and are accessible only to staff who need them to care for you. We keep records
    for as long as the law requires.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you at any time by emailing{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or calling <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
